   "text": "<!DOCTYPE html><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head>\n<title>Immaculate Conception Church</title>\n </head>\n\t<body id=\"sys_background\">\n <div class=\"wrapper\">\n <div class=\"page\">\n <div class=\"ys_header\">\n <div class=\"ys_heading\">\n <h1><a id=\"sys_heading\" href=\"./\">Immaculate Conception Catholic Church</a></h1>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"ys_nav_wrap\">\n <div id=\"menu\" class=\"sys_navigation\">\n <ul class=\"sys_navigation\">\n <li id=\"ys_menu_0\" class=\"selected first\"><a href=\"./\" title=\"Home\">HOME</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_1\"><a href=\"mass-times---parish-schedules.php\" title=\"Mass Times\">Mass Times </a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_2\"><a href=\"icc-bulletins.php\" title=\"Bulletins\">Bulletins</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_3\"><a href=\"directions-to-our-parish.php\" title=\"Directions\">Directions</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_4\"><a href=\"pastoral-staff.php\" title=\"Parish Staff\">Parish Staff</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_5\"><a href=\"sacraments.php\" title=\"Sacraments &amp; Blessings\">Sacraments &amp; Blessings</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_6\"><a href=\"funerals.php\" title=\"Funerals\">Funerals &amp; Memorials</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_7\"><a href=\"parish-pastoral-council.php\" title=\"Parish Pastoral Council\">Parish Pastoral Council</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_8\"><a href=\"religious-education.php\" title=\"Religious Education\">Religious Education</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_9\"><a href=\"finance-council.php\" title=\"Finance Council\">Finance Council</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_10\"><a href=\"council-of-ministries.php\" title=\"Council of Ministries\">Council of Ministries</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_11\"><a href=\"join-parish-ministries.php\" title=\"Join Parish Ministries\">Join Parish Ministries</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_12\"><a href=\"wedding-plan-norms.php\" title=\"Wedding Plan Norms\">Wedding Plan Norms</a></li>\n <li id=\"ys_menu_13\" class=\"last\"><a href=\"dcfcc-2026.php\" title=\"DCFCC 2026\">DCFCC 2026</a></li>\n </ul>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"ys_banner_wrap\">\n <div id=\"sys_banner\">\n <div class=\"banner_overlay\"></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n <div class=\"ys_content\">\n <div id=\"content\">\n<div class=\"layout_1-column sys_layout\">\n <div id=\"layout_row1\">\n <div id=\"sys_region_1\" class=\"zone_top\"><div id=\"I41c98f21f5584e1ba5876f1f132923a3\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I41c98f21f5584e1ba5876f1f132923a3_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>ALOHA AND WELCOME TO YOUR OHANA!</strong></h3>\n<h5><strong>Immaculate Conception Catholic Church sends a warm aloha to all families! Browse through the many activities and programs and join the parish for weekday and Sunday Masses.&nbsp; </strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>Your generous donations support religious education programs, ministries and church projects throughout the year. Support us by&nbsp;</strong><strong>1) Writing a tax-deductible check payable to Immaculate Conception Catholic Church and mail to 4453 Kapaia Road Lihu`e, HI 96766.&nbsp;</strong><strong>2) Hand deliver to the church office, Monday to Friday from 8 am to 12 pm. 3) Give to a hospitality minister during Mass or 4</strong><strong>) Give through our secured&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.eservicepayments.com/cgi-bin/Vanco_ver3.vps?appver3=tYgT1GfNxRUldiimjHMvOcPi-Cy7oT0bwlxV_HKbl_bbto7rg8irIX1_lb7hFlma2evTpo0mld6BrVzd2nG0p9ZHrSe4bvgqG-Iy7IB2fZY=&amp;ver=3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ONLINE DONATION</a>&nbsp;site.</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong>Check out our IC<a href=\"resources/Parish_Pastoral_Plan_2022-2026/IC%20Parish%20Pastoral%20Plan%202022-2026%20-%20Revised%2012-14-21%20compressed.pdf\"><span>&nbsp;PARISH PASTORAL PLAN 2022-2026</span></a>&nbsp;to learn more about parish goals or visit our office for details. Mahalo and God Bless Always!</strong></h5></div></div><div id=\"I87738ffc613944ac9b95cda8cf1f6761\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I87738ffc613944ac9b95cda8cf1f6761 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I87738ffc613944ac9b95cda8cf1f6761\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I76634b45915841dc9ad15c8f5d49867f\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div><div id=\"Right_I87738ffc613944ac9b95cda8cf1f6761\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I64aacbdfece741e59e6147fbf780da7e\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I64aacbdfece741e59e6147fbf780da7e_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>Congratulations to Luigi Quiacusan, Lily Glick, Skyler Tanicala and Aubry Agena (not shown) for receiving the ICC Filipino Catholic Club Scholarship for 2026. Our recipients are active youth leaders at their respective high schools and especially at Immaculate Conception Church. &nbsp;All four graduates will continue their educational pursuits in the Fall semester.&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5></h5>\n<h5></h5></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I5b9af6e4ef7e40098a88419076236e13\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I734cc1068c484d39b032a6f569332e24\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I734cc1068c484d39b032a6f569332e24\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I734cc1068c484d39b032a6f569332e24\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I734cc1068c484d39b032a6f569332e24\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I734cc1068c484d39b032a6f569332e24\"><div id=\"I741b3448a2f847c4bb2998d4c46f0f15\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I741b3448a2f847c4bb2998d4c46f0f15 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I741b3448a2f847c4bb2998d4c46f0f15\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I170\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I170\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I170\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I170\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I170\"><div id=\"Iaab07ef53ac94579a79ad46ee5baad55\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Iaab07ef53ac94579a79ad46ee5baad55_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h2><strong>MASS SCHEDULE</strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>6:30 am -&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span>Rosary</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>7:00 am - Daily Mass</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>FRIDAY</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>6:15 am - First Friday - Adoration of the Blessed Sacrament at ICC Church</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>6:00 pm - All other Friday's - Adoration of the Blessed Sacrament at IC School Convent</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>SATURDAYS</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>4:00 pm -&nbsp;</span></strong><strong><span>Reconciliation</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>5:00 pm - Mass</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>SUNDAYS</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>7:00 am - Mass</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>9:30 am - Mass</span></strong></h2>\n<h2><strong><span>4:30 pm - Mass</span></strong></h2></div></div><div id=\"I3ebb467c96b746a19a0e90059e47f1af\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I3ebb467c96b746a19a0e90059e47f1af_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h2><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/14EzHLXMWvg/?mibextid=wwXIfr\">ICP Live Streaming (click here!)</a></h2></div></div><div id=\"I8336b77f54dd4c0e94c7632ed3f82c77\" class=\"Button_Default\">\n<div id=\"I8336b77f54dd4c0e94c7632ed3f82c77_sys_button\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"I8336b77f54dd4c0e94c7632ed3f82c77_sys_button sys_button medium rounded solid\">\n <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/share/14EzHLXMWvg/?mibextid=wwXIfr\">\n ICP Live Streaming\n </a>\n</div></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div><div id=\"Ice5f7f689bfc492281d829326879635d\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"If0832a2d1e174505929eb91ab4c18bb9\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"If0832a2d1e174505929eb91ab4c18bb9_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>Congratulations to our High School graduates! May our Lord Bless and protect each of you as you continue the next chapter in your life!</h5></div></div></div><div id=\"Right_I741b3448a2f847c4bb2998d4c46f0f15\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I0acd14cb7e994a6b855b66c47ce1278e\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"I3f0205da16e54563b57229b73a20eef0\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I3f0205da16e54563b57229b73a20eef0_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><span><strong>ICC SCHEDULE AND ACTIVITIES</strong></span></h3>\n<h5><span><strong>2nd &amp; 3rd SUNDAYS - EDGE</strong></span><span><strong>&nbsp;MinistryMiddle School at 2:30 pm, Parish Hall</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span><strong>2nd &amp; 3rd SUNDAYS&nbsp;</strong></span><span>- LIFE TEEN Ministry High School at 2:30 pm, Parish Hall&nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5><span><strong>1st SUNDAYS - Immaculate Conception Filipino Catholic Club (ICFCC)</strong></span><span><strong>&nbsp;at 11am, Parish Hall</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><span><strong>2nd SUNDAYS - Fellowship Sundays</strong></span><span><strong>&nbsp;at 11am, Parish Hall</strong></span></h5>\n<h5><strong>1st TUESDAYS - Parish Pastoral Council at 6 pm, Parish Hall</strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><span>WEDNESDAYS&nbsp;</span><span>- Yard Crew Volunteers at 8 am&nbsp;</span></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><span>THURSDAYS&nbsp;- Shawl Ministry at 9 am</span></strong></h5>\n<h5><strong><span>FRIDAYS&nbsp;</span><span>- Church &amp; Hall Weekly Housekeeping at 8 am</span></strong></h5>\n<h3><span><strong>&nbsp;DATES TO REMEMBER</strong></span></h3>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div><div id=\"I46f89aeb394f4e89bcdc819044a61373\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I1a3eba12d51c49ea9190eebce1d7e355\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I1a3eba12d51c49ea9190eebce1d7e355 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I1a3eba12d51c49ea9190eebce1d7e355\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I1eae69d33cce4547be3aa514ba7f58ba\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div><div id=\"Right_I1a3eba12d51c49ea9190eebce1d7e355\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I234b6766b9064eef811d0a9354c0a4fe\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I234b6766b9064eef811d0a9354c0a4fe_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>1827-2027 - The Catholic Church in Hawai`i prepares to celebrate a historic milestone - the 200th Anniversary of the arrival of the Catholic faith in our islands. &nbsp;Beginning in July 2026 and continuing through 2027, parishes throughout the Diocese of Honolulu will commemorate two centuries of faith, sacrifice, evangelization, and hope.</h5></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I3f14dede9c254daa9190d4c4f04796d8\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I3f14dede9c254daa9190d4c4f04796d8_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3>DIOCESAN PRAYER FOR THE 200th ANNIVERSARY OF CATHOLICISM IN HAWAI`I</h3></div></div><div id=\"I288b3dae902b44edaf72448da682794f\" class=\"Text_Default\"><div id=\"I288b3dae902b44edaf72448da682794f_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt old_text_widget clear_fix\"><p><span><b><i>Heavenly Father,&nbsp;</i></b></span></p><p><span><b><i>With grateful hearts, we praise and thank You for two hundred years of Catholic faith </i></b></span><b><i>in these Hawaiian Islands.</i></b></p><p><b><i>We remember with deep gratitude the courageous pioneers of the Gospel: the missionaries of the Congregation of the Sacred Hearts of Jesus and Mary, who crossed oceans;&nbsp;</i></b></p><p><b><i>the Native Hawaiian faithful who embraced Christ; the clergy, religious, and lay leaders who planted, nurtured, and strengthened Your Church throughout the generations.</i></b></p><p><b><i>Bless all those who have gone before us, marked with the sign of faith. May their witness continue to inspire us to live as faithful disciples of Your Son.&nbsp;</i></b></p><p><b><i>We thank You for the Church of today, whose members continue the mission of proclaiming the Good News through prayer, service, and love.&nbsp;</i></b></p><p><span><b><i>Renew us in faith, strengthen us in hope, and unite us in charity, that we may be living witnesses of Your presence in our islands.</i></b></span></p><p><b><i>As we look to the future, pour out Your Holy Spirit upon the generations yet to come. Raise up holy vocations to the priesthood, diaconate, consecrated life, and married life.&nbsp;</i></b></p><p><b><i>Guide our young people to know and follow Your will. Grant that the faith handed down to us may flourish in every heart and every home.&nbsp;</i></b></p><p><b><i>Through the intercession of the Blessed Virgin Mary, Our Lady, Queen of Peace, Saint Damien of Molokaʻi, Saint Marianne Cope, and all the holy men and women who have served the Church in Hawaiʻi, lead us ever closer to Your Son, Jesus Christ.</i></b></p><p><b><i>May the next century of faith be marked by holiness, missionary zeal, and steadfast love, so that all people may come to know and glorify You.&nbsp;</i></b></p><p><b><i>We ask this through Christ our Lord. Amen.</i></b></p></div></div><div id=\"I9a58b05766b94b418ea5d796a0108884\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"I5e7773e752d840dca245b8784b3c584d\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I5e7773e752d840dca245b8784b3c584d_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3>DIOCESAN PRAYER FOR VOCATIONS - ROMAN CATHOLIC DIOCESE OF HONOLULU</h3></div></div><div id=\"I463915a19893443f832af0fababa5839\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I463915a19893443f832af0fababa5839_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>&nbsp;Heavenly Father, your divine Son taught us to pray to the Lord of the Harvest to send laborers into His vineyard. We earnestly beg you to bless our Diocese and our world with many priests, deacons and religious who will love you fervently and gladly and courageously spend their lives in service to your Son's Church, especially the poor and the needy. &nbsp;Bless our families and our children, and choose from our homes those whom you desire for this holy work. &nbsp;Teach them to respond generously and keep them ever faithful in following your Son Jesus Christ, that under the guidance of the Holy Spirit and with the inspiration of Saint Damien and Saint Marianne the Good News of redemption may be brought to all. We ask this through Christ our Lord. Amen.&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.catholichawaii.org/catholic-living/vocations/diocesan-priesthood/\">&nbsp;TO LEARN MORE ABOUT THE VOCATION PROCESS (Click Here!)</a></h5></div></div><div id=\"If018399490ff4bcc936d07c4a8d10e5d\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_If018399490ff4bcc936d07c4a8d10e5d column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_If018399490ff4bcc936d07c4a8d10e5d\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"Id328a50b38114b1b9ea7e9e256721294\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-Id328a50b38114b1b9ea7e9e256721294\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-Id328a50b38114b1b9ea7e9e256721294\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-Id328a50b38114b1b9ea7e9e256721294\">\n <div id=\"Panel_Id328a50b38114b1b9ea7e9e256721294\"><div id=\"I1225e4b6cc5142e0ab7d0f9e7526d0a2\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I1225e4b6cc5142e0ab7d0f9e7526d0a2_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>REGISTRATION </strong><strong>FORMS</strong></h3></div></div><div id=\"I8ecd4af7e9c54ce79ee258b87562fdc9\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I8ecd4af7e9c54ce79ee258b87562fdc9 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I8ecd4af7e9c54ce79ee258b87562fdc9\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I475c4be1d07d4bd49438fd258a71adb7\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I475c4be1d07d4bd49438fd258a71adb7_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>&nbsp;<strong>ELEMENTARY LEVEL</strong><a href=\"resources/Youth_Ministry_Form_fillable_Files_2021-2022/Elementary%20PreK%20to%205th%20Grade%20Registration%20Form%202021-2022%20form%20fillable.docx\">&nbsp;</a></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/Registration%20Form%20Religious%20Ed.%202025-2026.pdf\">Pre-K to 5th Grade</a><a href=\"resources/Religious_Education_Forms/Elementary%20PreK%20to%205th%20Grade%20Registration%20Form%202020-2021%20form%20fillable.docx\"></a></h5>\n<p><a href=\"resources/IC%20Registration%20-%20Elementary%20Application%202023.pdf\">PDF Application</a></p></div></div><div id=\"I15cc8f75a7604ba6b7162ff4ae421cb0\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I166cd3a0be0546be93d906dfc3986342\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I166cd3a0be0546be93d906dfc3986342_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><a href=\"resources/Religious_Education_Forms/IC%20Registration%20-%20Life%20Teen%20Application%202020.docx\"><strong></strong></a><a href=\"resources/Religious_Education_Forms/IC%20Registration%20-%20Life%20Teen%20Application%202020.pdf\"><strong></strong></a><strong>HIGH SCHOOL LEVEL</strong></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/IC%20Registration%20-%20Life%20Teen%20Application%202023.docx\">9th to 12th Grade</a><a href=\"resources/Religious_Education_Forms/IC%20Registration%20-%20Life%20Teen%20Application%202020.pdf\"></a></h5>\n<p><a href=\"resources/Registration%20Form.pdf\" title=\"High School Registration Form\">PDF Application</a></p></div></div></div><div id=\"Right_I8ecd4af7e9c54ce79ee258b87562fdc9\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I04134e3e3ecb4377bb9a95afca0aa902\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I04134e3e3ecb4377bb9a95afca0aa902_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><strong>MIDDLE SCHOOL LEVEL</strong></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/IC%20Registration%20-%20EDGE%20-%20Middle%20School%20Application%20-%20Form%20Fillable%202023-2024.docx\">6th to 8th Grade</a></h5>\n<p><a href=\"resources/Registration%20Form.pdf\" title=\"Middle School Registration Form\">PDF Application</a></p></div></div><div id=\"I935d24f07e9b4860852f1b632140a848\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"Ia7618527615247a384314d4ae1e85b31\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Ia7618527615247a384314d4ae1e85b31_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><strong>ORDER OF&nbsp;</strong><strong>CHRISTIAN INITIATION ADULTS</strong></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/IC%20Registration%20-%20Rite%20of%20Christian%20Initiation%20of%20Adults%202023.docx\">18 and Above</a></h5>\n<p><a href=\"resources/IC%20Registration%20-%20Rite%20of%20Christian%20Initiation%20of%20Adults%202023.pdf\">PDF Application</a></p></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I62a3e1e254f946ef9becaa1c036e7644\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I8e8664734414468598d161ef45c0e18f\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I8e8664734414468598d161ef45c0e18f_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><a href=\"resources/Religious_Education_Forms/Kauai%20Catholic%20Campus%20Ministry%20Registration%20Form%202020-2021%20form%20fillable.docx\"><strong></strong></a><a href=\"resources/Youth_Ministry_Form_fillable_Files_2021-2022/Kauai%20Catholic%20Campus%20Ministry%20Registration%20Form%202021-2022%20form%20fillable.docx\"><strong>YOUNG ADULTS MINISTRY</strong></a></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/Registration%20Form-%20Young%20Adult%202023.docx\">Young Adults (18-39)</a></h5>\n<p><a href=\"resources/Registration%20Form-%20Young%20Adult%202023.pdf\">PDF Application</a></p>\n<p><br></p></div></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div></div><div id=\"Right_If018399490ff4bcc936d07c4a8d10e5d\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I5094bad291f746c187e2574effc02850\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I5094bad291f746c187e2574effc02850_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>JOURNEY TOGETHER WITH&nbsp;</strong><strong>OUR&nbsp; YOUTH MINISTRY!</strong></h3></div></div><div id=\"I988d86a1ea494e67b607d43bc5f18259\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"I79a9f313a05c45da80c7e6cf7f9d1a4d\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I79a9f313a05c45da80c7e6cf7f9d1a4d_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>Our Youth Ministry consists of two groups: Life Teen High School (ages 14-17) and EDGE Middle School (ages 11-13). We journey together with our youth and their families to form a deeper relationship with Jesus Christ and His Church.&nbsp; At ICC, unique opportunities for evangelization are presented, that are tailored to the needs of youth with fun and safe activities, with the emphasis on the Mass as the core and summit of our faith life journey. For more information on enrolling your child or would like to volunteer as a youth leader or support member, please contact the Church Office at (808)245-2432</h5>\n<p><br></p></div></div><div id=\"I9baa2bb5b391402db4c90dfabbf6faa9\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div></div></div><div id=\"Ic03cab1ca11e4737b630738ced226a9d\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_Ic03cab1ca11e4737b630738ced226a9d column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_Ic03cab1ca11e4737b630738ced226a9d\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I6e89f8ca72be4bee860f1900c80d909e\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"Idecd9b1f2b844d9ebe188594dc0fb0a5\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Idecd9b1f2b844d9ebe188594dc0fb0a5_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><span>Congratulations to our new batch of Altar Servers who were recently installed in June 2026. &nbsp;They will serve at different masses during Sunday Masses ands during special occasions. Please contact John Constantino at someone@example.org to enroll your child in Altar Server Training. &nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/Altar%20Server%20Application%20Form%20-%2003-17-26.pdf\">&nbsp;ALTAR SERVER APPLICATION (Click Here!)</a></h5></div></div></div><div id=\"Right_Ic03cab1ca11e4737b630738ced226a9d\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I957159e27b644b6dad126fa5fcdb2fe8\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I957159e27b644b6dad126fa5fcdb2fe8_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong><span></span></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong><span>RELIGIOUS EDUCATION CATECHISTS</span></strong></h3>\n<h5><span>Aloha and thank you to our commissioned Religious Education volunteer catechists for successfully completing anther academic year. Please share your gifts and talents with our youth by calling our church office to make a difference in the lives of our ohana. Mahalo for answering God's call!</span></h5>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span></span></p></div></div><div id=\"I550107e396b647388121655bbf67cb37\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I838b4c84f1b54207b60c8a5c5fd64559\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I838b4c84f1b54207b60c8a5c5fd64559_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong><span>RELIGIOUS EDUCATION CLASSES</span></strong></h3>\n<h5><span>ICC is accepting applications for students from Pre-K to adults. &nbsp;Classes are taught in person. Print and sign completed form an<span>d deliver to the Church Office between Monday to Saturday from 8:00 am to 12 noon. Please contact (808)245-2432 for more information.</span></span></h5>\n<h3><strong>DIOCESE OF HONOLULU SAFE ENVIRONMENT POLICY AND CODE OF CONDUCT</strong></h3>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.catholichawaii.org/media/650450/diocese-of-honolulu-safe-environment-policy_effective-07-01-2020-may-2021-upload.pdf\">Reconciliation, Protection, Accountability:&nbsp;</a><a href=\"https://www.catholichawaii.org/media/650450/diocese-of-honolulu-safe-environment-policy_effective-07-01-2020-may-2021-upload.pdf\">The Safe Environment Policies</a></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.catholichawaii.org/media/649973/diocese-of-honolulu-code-of-conduct_update-effective-07-01-2020.pdf\">Code of Conduct for Employees, Volunteers, Contractors, Religious and Clergy</a></h5>\n<h3><strong>MISCELLANEOUS FORMS</strong></h3>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/Safe%20Environment%20Permission%20Form%20-%20Fall%202021.pdf\">Safe Environment Permission Form</a></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"https://www.catholichawaii.org/diocesan-offices/safe-environment-child-and-youth-protection/education-children-and-youth/\">Safe Environment - Circles of Care Lessons for Children and Youth</a></h5>\n<h5><a href=\"resources/Youth_Ministry_2020/digital-and-photo-consent-form_final3_072720.pdf\">Digital Ministry and Photo Consent Form</a></h5></div></div><div id=\"Icd0650e69bea40c2814fc201824f90e5\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"Iaacda619c900430b8562f355d79df390\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_Iaacda619c900430b8562f355d79df390 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_Iaacda619c900430b8562f355d79df390\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I175\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I175\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I175\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I175\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I175\"><div id=\"Ic35e8e0dec5e40ccbf5460cf03a7c675\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"I912d9a31a8e145398d45f085458cc0d8\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I912d9a31a8e145398d45f085458cc0d8_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3>&nbsp;<strong>PRAYER FOR A STEWARDSHIP PARISH&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><em>(Diocese of Honolulu)</em></h3>\n<h5>Generous and Loving Creator, you have called us to Malama I ka Makana (Cherish the Gift). &nbsp;As disciples of your Son, we ask that your Spirit open our minds and hearts to more deeply appreciate your countless blessings.Increase your transforming spirit within us, so as to nurture our call to stewardship as a way of life marked always by faith-filled prayer, service to others and generous giving.With the kokua of St. Marianne and St. Damien, teach us to be good stewards so we may return a hundred-fold&nbsp;the makana entrusted to us.We pray this through Jesus Christ, our Lord.&nbsp; Amen.</h5>\n<h3><strong>PRAYER FOR A STEWARDSHIP PARISH&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong><em>(from the Archdiocese of Detroit)</em></h3>\n<h5>Dear Heavenly Father, my parish is composed of people like me; I help make it what it is. &nbsp;It will be friendly if I am. Its pews will be filled, if I help fill them. It will do great work, if I work. &nbsp;It will make generous gifts to many causes, If I am a generous giver. It will bring other people into its worship and fellowship, If I invite and bring them. &nbsp;It will be a parish of&nbsp;loyalty&nbsp;and love,&nbsp;of fearlessness and faith, and a parish with a noble spirit, If I, who make it what it is, am filled with these same things. &nbsp;Therefore, with your help, O God, I shall dedicate myself to the task of being all things that I want my parish to be. Amen.</h5></div></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div></div><div id=\"Right_Iaacda619c900430b8562f355d79df390\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"Ie52cea81a02145648dea7d4eaf487f85\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"I173\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I173\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I173\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I173\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I173\"><div id=\"I174\" class=\"Text_Default\"><div id=\"I174_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt old_text_widget clear_fix\"><p align=\"center\"><b><u><font size=\"4\">OUR VISION</font></u></b></p><p align=\"center\"><b><u><font size=\"4\"><br></font></u></b></p><p align=\"center\"><font face=\"Georgia\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span>We, the Christian Community of Immaculate Conception, Lihue,&nbsp;</span><span>are called to be Stewards of the Gospel.&nbsp;</span></font><span>Centered on the Holy Eucharist,&nbsp;</span><span>we live our lives on th</span></font></font><font size=\"4\"><span>e four pillars of stewardship:&nbsp;</span><span>hospitality, prayer, formation and service.&nbsp;</span></font><span>This is our call.</span></p><p align=\"center\"><span><br></span></p><p align=\"center\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"Georgia\"><u><b>OUR MISSION</b></u></font></p><blockquote><p align=\"center\"><font size=\"4\" face=\"Georgia\">Responding to the call of Jesus&nbsp;and inspired by the example of the Blessed Mother,&nbsp;the Immaculate Conception, we live stewardship towards a holy way of life.</font></p></blockquote><p align=\"center\"><br></p></div></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div></div></div></div><div id=\"Ic810f6ef067c47fe8c00328a06547397\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Ic810f6ef067c47fe8c00328a06547397_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>ASH WEDNESDAY</strong></h3></div></div><div id=\"I1689944becf14c28bf53e6bda1988100\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I1689944becf14c28bf53e6bda1988100_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><em>\"The Season of Lent is more than changing our routines for forty days. The Season of Lent is a time for us to introspect and see where we are at in our relationship with God. The Season of Lent desires our spiritual growth. The Season of Lent targets our hearts so we can speak and act like Christ Jesus as we continue our faith-life journey here on earth.\" <a href=\"resources/Fr._Edison_Homilies/February%2017%202021%20Homily%20for%20Fr%20Edison%20Pamintuan.pdf\">(F</a></em><a href=\"resources/Fr._Edison_Homilies/February%2017%202021%20Homily%20for%20Fr%20Edison%20Pamintuan.pdf\"><em>rom the Ash Wednesday Homily of Fr. Edison Pamintuan, MS)</em></a></h5></div></div><div id=\"Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918\" class=\"Gallery_Default\"><div class=\"yola_gallery_widget\">\n <div class=\"round-corners\">\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9297.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9311.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9323.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9343.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9287.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9344.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9334.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_8041.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9303.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9340.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_9273.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_Iffeafcad55504ff587aab02eb6a87918]\" href=\"resources/Ash_Wednesday/IMG_8031.jpg\" data-title=\"\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n <span class=\"round-corners-shadow\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n </div>\n</div></div><div id=\"I70ed027d44294d2c8d51d8b65e86ce90\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I7063dcc417c6442ab50b62457f063bde\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I7063dcc417c6442ab50b62457f063bde column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I7063dcc417c6442ab50b62457f063bde\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I95da11b563f446b6bd7e575bca79e82e\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I95da11b563f446b6bd7e575bca79e82e_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><span>The Advent season is a time of preparation that directs our hearts and minds to Christ’s second coming at the end of time and also to the anniversary of the Lord’s birth on Christmas. The final days of Advent, from December 17 to December 24, focus particularly on our preparation for the celebrations of the Nativity of our Lord.</span></h5></div></div><div id=\"I2c17b8c1bc744fa1b33cec489cd4928f\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div><div id=\"Right_I7063dcc417c6442ab50b62457f063bde\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I3edeb82e0f884d429f381c1258d9eb70\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I22af9d5c9d4847599133caa17cc2b36e\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I0f9564246608476cb726d74642550918\" class=\"Text_Default\"><div id=\"I0f9564246608476cb726d74642550918_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt old_text_widget clear_fix\"><h5><span>The Christmas season starts on Dec. 25 during the celebration of the birth of Christ. This followed by the feast of the Epiphany, along with the visit of the Magi, and other events from the childhood of Jesus.&nbsp; The season concludes with the Feast of the Baptism of the Lord in January.</span></h5></div></div><div id=\"Ied36430f2b4e4cd59547c693a8349b7b\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_Ied36430f2b4e4cd59547c693a8349b7b column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_Ied36430f2b4e4cd59547c693a8349b7b\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"Ife1f63a911e14906ac630d9590395a75\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div><div id=\"Right_Ied36430f2b4e4cd59547c693a8349b7b\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"Ib65cad46586a4dca8626f95ed0f8d461\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Ib65cad46586a4dca8626f95ed0f8d461_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5>IC Parish will hold another Christmas Concert in December. Under the direction of Sr. Su and Sr Marina, children from Pre-K to Young Adults will dazzle all in attendance with Christmas songs, dances and instrumental music,harking the birth of Jesus Christ, our Lord and Savior.</h5></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"Ie715ea3217e74ff0ae6c391e1812988e\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I7c1089f2651044b2ac25ba9db5dc1e0d\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I7c1089f2651044b2ac25ba9db5dc1e0d column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I7c1089f2651044b2ac25ba9db5dc1e0d\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I29e80ebbeb9f40afbb8e77ed2d1b783f\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"Iafb7a7793a9742c9a048e6892d39eb2a\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Iafb7a7793a9742c9a048e6892d39eb2a_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><span>Throughout the month of November and December, IC church goers sponsored Angel Ornaments. &nbsp;Each ornament had a special individual request to help brighten their lives during the Christmas season. This year, we were blessed to help over thirty families!</span></h5>\n<h5><span>Mahalo for supporting the Angel Tree Project for the past ten years. Your continued sponsorship for the donation of gifts have brought immense joy and happiness to so many children and families enrolled in the Women in Need Program. &nbsp;</span></h5></div></div><div id=\"I4363f4a5624a44bda6edac6e441b49af\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div><div id=\"Right_I7c1089f2651044b2ac25ba9db5dc1e0d\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"Id05f14e0d72e4d32bd1d7e096b98faee\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Id05f14e0d72e4d32bd1d7e096b98faee_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><span>The church thanks everyone for the overwhelming response to the request for non-perishable items such as canned goods to support the ICC Food Drive Ministry. &nbsp;This program started in Spring 2021 and has helped to build our canned food stock-pile along with non-food supplies. &nbsp;</span></h5>\n<h5><span>To join this important ministry, please join our meetings every second Sunday of the month at 10:45 am in the New Parish Hall, or contact Carol Simon at 808-555-0100 to see how you can get involved in preparing food bags or conducting deliveries to the homeless.</span></h5></div></div><div id=\"I855b5b236d724d4cae8967ff2798b5cf\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div><div id=\"I917abd95a1f443448111b79e7df166dd\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I45c46b75a97e467dbbc3e1ab4c18bbc0\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I0be6f07ab9994516aa5cd18366c1bb52\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I0be6f07ab9994516aa5cd18366c1bb52 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I0be6f07ab9994516aa5cd18366c1bb52\" class=\"left\">&nbsp;</div><div id=\"Right_I0be6f07ab9994516aa5cd18366c1bb52\" class=\"right\">&nbsp;</div></div></div><div id=\"I20278cb38e21420b98e371e8b9bada4d\" class=\"Horizontal_Line_Default\"> <div></div>\n</div><div id=\"I177\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I177\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I177\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I177\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I177\"><div id=\"I0a8d0b76347f497d84a2aad748c24085\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I0a8d0b76347f497d84a2aad748c24085_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>OUR DREAM CAME TRUE!</strong></h3></div></div><div id=\"Ia36a9991f38c4e279a3f17fa114d77ff\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_Ia36a9991f38c4e279a3f17fa114d77ff column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_Ia36a9991f38c4e279a3f17fa114d77ff\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I5a7a6eed39ea466ea10ec2475a86c214\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div><div id=\"Right_Ia36a9991f38c4e279a3f17fa114d77ff\" class=\"right\"><div id=\"I919108f6b6794ea4b09d752aa46146de\" class=\"Image_Default\"></div></div></div></div><div id=\"I178\" class=\"Text_Default\"><div id=\"I178_sys_txt\" class=\"sys_txt old_text_widget clear_fix\"><p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Georgia\" size=\"4\"><span>Our parish has blossomed into a vibrant and exciting community. With the exceptional leadership of our parish team and dedicated stewards, many programs such as feeding the homeless; helping women and children in need; ministering to the elderly and homebound; youth ministries and children's choir are growing significantly.</span></font></p><p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Georgia\" size=\"4\">With the larger meeting spaces, we now have the&nbsp;means&nbsp;</font><span><font size=\"4\">to continue our mission of stewardship and service to our families and the community at large.</font>&nbsp;</span></p><p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Georgia\" size=\"4\">Help us to continue our good work:&nbsp;</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Gill Sans MT, sans-serif\" size=\"4\"></font></p><p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Georgia\" size=\"4\">1) Write your tax-deductible&nbsp;check payable to ICC Building Fund and mail to Immaculate Conception Church 4453 Kapaia Road Lihue, HI 96766.&nbsp;</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Georgia\" size=\"4\">2) Hand-deliver to the Immaculate Conception Church office, Monday to Saturday from 8 am to 12 pm.</font></p><p align=\"left\"><font face=\"Georgia\" size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">3) </font><a href=\"https://www.eservicepayments.com/cgi-bin/Vanco_ver3.vps?appver3=tYgT1GfNxRUldiimjHMvOcPi-Cy7oT0bwlxV_HKbl_bbto7rg8irIX1_lb7hFlma2evTpo0mld6BrVzd2nG0p9ZHrSe4bvgqG-Iy7IB2fZY=&amp;ver=3\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>DONATE HERE</b></font></a>&nbsp;on our secured site.<font color=\"#000066\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#000000\">To learn&nbsp;more about our building project and our parish pastoral plan, please call 808-555-0100. Mahalo and God Bless Always!</font></font></p></div></div></div>\n </div>\n </div>\n</div><div id=\"I179\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I179\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I179\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I179\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I179\"><div id=\"Ibb98956c0b144d52a1ebe7736027edd2\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Ibb98956c0b144d52a1ebe7736027edd2_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>&nbsp;ICC PARISH HAPPENINGS AND ACTIVITIES</strong></h3></div></div><div id=\"I183\" class=\"Gallery_Default\"><div class=\"yola_gallery_widget\">\n <div class=\"polaroid\">\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/Photos/Ambo.JPG\" data-title=\"Ambo\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/FCC_OFFICERS_IMG_4125-2.jpg\" data-title=\"ICC Filipino Catholic Club\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/10.19.09%20003.jpg\" data-title=\"Our Lady of Fatima Grotto\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/LIFE_TEEN_IMG_2337.JPG\" data-title=\"Life Teen - Life Night Session\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/IMG_0921.JPG\" data-title=\"Summer Bible Camp\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/IMG_0780.JPG\" data-title=\"Religious Education Class\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/IMG_8324.JPG\" data-title=\"Palm Sunday Altar Environment\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/IMG_1736.jpg\" data-title=\"Main Altar\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item portrait\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/IMG_8507.JPG\" data-title=\"Adoration of the Blesses Sacrament\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n <span class=\"item landscape\">\n <a class=\"backing\" data-lightbox=\"lightbox[gallery_widget_I183]\" href=\"resources/ICC_PICS_2020/SLEEPING_GIANT_IMG_4557.jpg\" data-title=\"Life Teen Rosary Hike\">\n <span class=\"image\"></span>\n </a>\n </span>\n </div>\n</div></div><div id=\"I288\" class=\"Panel_Default\"> \n <div id=\"yola-panel-I288\">\n <div id=\"yola-panel-background-I288\">\n </div>\n <div id=\"yola-panel-inner-I288\">\n <div id=\"Panel_I288\"><div id=\"I959315e571e5455f8a769ad39b6d6a82\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I959315e571e5455f8a769ad39b6d6a82_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h3><strong>LINKS OF INTEREST</strong></h3></div></div><div id=\"I289\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I289 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I289\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I290\" class=\"Layout1_Default\"><div class=\"column_I290 column_divider\"><div id=\"Left_I290\" class=\"left\"><div id=\"I8a9297ed907d45cdb84510fa543c701d\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"I8a9297ed907d45cdb84510fa543c701d_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><a href=\"http://hawaiicee.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Engaged Encounter</a></h5></div></div><div id=\"Id30e570e0d2848fb8d4d78b4b8811a51\" class=\"Text_2_Default\">\n<div id=\"Id30e570e0d2848fb8d4d78b4b8811a51_sys_txt\" systemelement=\"true\" class=\"sys_txt sys_text_widget new-text-widget\"><h5><a href=\"https://www.usccb.org/committees/catholic-campaign-human-development\">Catholic Campaign for Human Development</a></h5></div></div></div><div id=\"Right_I290\" class=\"right\">